    "blurb": "Get the users involved in active user tasks",
    "overview": "Find everyone involved in a process instance's active user tasks, from assignees to candidate users and candidate group members, so you can notify the right people. Add or exclude specific users and groups as needed, and keep working on OIDC-secured clusters.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Find the right people for every user task",
    "splashDescription": "Collect every user involved in a process instance's active user tasks: the assignee, candidate users, and members of candidate groups. The connector removes duplicates and adds each user's full details, such as name and email, so later steps in your process can reach the right people. Fine-tune the result for each task by including or excluding specific users and groups, and keep getting results on OIDC-secured clusters where user lookups are restricted.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/873770/overview/img6092093285271540306.png?a7361d781aa941793949249dd4816f01",
